Yeah, they brought Revolution.

00:53:41.580 --> 00:53:44.100
Yeah, they bought a company
called Revolution Analytics.

00:53:44.100 --> 00:53:44.600
Yes.

00:53:47.120 --> 00:53:51.110
Another Slido question
was, thoughts to introduce

00:53:51.110 --> 00:53:53.630
a Posit-consulting arm?

00:53:53.630 --> 00:53:57.050
Imagine there are many small-
and mid-sized businesses that

00:53:57.050 --> 00:54:00.350
could benefit from data science
but don't have the resources.

00:54:03.690 --> 00:54:05.580
It comes up from time to time.

00:54:05.580 --> 00:54:09.230
I think that our
approach to consulting--

00:54:09.230 --> 00:54:11.240
one of the tricky
things about consulting

00:54:11.240 --> 00:54:17.320
is that to grow a
consulting business,

00:54:17.320 --> 00:54:20.060
you have to hire
a lot of people.

00:54:20.060 --> 00:54:24.490
And so to grow a significant
consulting business,

00:54:24.490 --> 00:54:27.310
you might need to hire
hundreds of people.

00:54:27.310 --> 00:54:29.830
And that in and of itself
creates a lot of challenges,

00:54:29.830 --> 00:54:33.020
like managing an organization
of hundreds of people.

00:54:33.020 --> 00:54:35.770
So we've tended to be more
on the building-a-product

00:54:35.770 --> 00:54:40.510
organization, which can
be smaller, doesn't demand

00:54:40.510 --> 00:54:47.050
so much hiring for growth, and
try to find partners that are

00:54:47.050 --> 00:54:48.343
growing consulting businesses.

00:54:48.343 --> 00:54:49.510
And some of them are larger.

00:54:49.510 --> 00:54:50.718
And some of them are smaller.

00:54:50.718 --> 00:54:55.060
Some of our best partners
are 5, 10, 15, 20 people.

00:54:55.060 --> 00:54:57.102
And some of them aspire
to be bigger than that.

00:54:57.102 --> 00:54:58.810
And some of them are
happy being smaller.

00:54:58.810 --> 00:55:03.460
But so we've wanted to scale
that presence through partners,

00:55:03.460 --> 00:55:05.710
rather than do it ourselves.

