If this was your first one, or
for the past year and a half,

01:07:40.310 --> 01:07:42.440
or however long we've
been doing this,

01:07:42.440 --> 01:07:45.080
thank you for coming to
spend time with us all.

01:07:45.080 --> 01:07:47.960
I hope you and your families
have a wonderful holiday

01:07:47.960 --> 01:07:49.780
season and happy new year.

